<title>SINGAPORE: FJ Benjamin half year net down 29.7 pct.</title>
<headline>FJ Benjamin half year net down 29.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     3.72   vs   5.29</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	    0.21   vs   0.29</p>
<p>    Turnover		     160.62   vs 120.39</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     3.77   vs   2.48</p>
<p>    Pretax			   7.55   vs   5.95</p>
<p>    Tax				2.01   vs   2.02</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (1.83)  vs   0.65</p>
<p>Note - Luxury goods retailer FJ Benjamin Holdings Ltd said its earnings were affected by poor performance in its Australian operations, despite an increase in turnover.</p>
<p>It said plans to rationalise the group's operations in Australia is being implemented.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
